{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51697","headline":"题常乐庵五云堂（常乐庵在崇德县西八十步。梁步监二年建。俗呼西寺。後入宋改悟空院。吴越时韦谦诗云云。） · 韦谦","name":"题常乐庵五云堂（常乐庵在崇德县西八十步。梁步监二年建。俗呼西寺。後入宋改悟空院。吴越时韦谦诗云云。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾匠慕先哲，至理皆融通。\n一法果有至，五云疑在空。\n讲香浸棐几，夜月锁帘栊。\n弋者何由预，冥冥出塞鸿。\n（同上）（〖1〗《至元嘉禾志》卷三二收此诗，署「节度韦谦」。\n又见《槜李诗系》卷三七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}